Okay, Matilda, here's the deal.

440
00:19:03,943 --> 00:19:05,910
I'm not really an inspector.

441
00:19:05,912 --> 00:19:07,578
I'm a shoplifter,
just like you.

442
00:19:07,580 --> 00:19:09,247
            Are-are you the one?

443
00:19:09,249 --> 00:19:11,449
             The savior foretold
                  in our legends

444
00:19:11,451 --> 00:19:13,184
                 come to free us
               from our bondage?

445
00:19:13,186 --> 00:19:15,019
Huh? No.

446
00:19:15,021 --> 00:19:16,787
                 Oh. That sucks.

447
00:19:16,789 --> 00:19:18,623
Have you seen this kid
around here?

448
00:19:18,625 --> 00:19:20,124
         Well, I don't know him,

449
00:19:20,126 --> 00:19:23,528
    but, uh, the latest batch of
    arrivals ended up in Zone Q.

450
00:19:24,763 --> 00:19:26,964
Wait! If-if you're getting
out of here,

451
00:19:26,966 --> 00:19:28,432
  could you take me with you?

452
00:19:28,434 --> 00:19:33,237
                     You have my
                  word, Matilda.

453
00:19:40,879 --> 00:19:42,547
            Steve?!

454
00:19:43,448 --> 00:19:44,949
              Floobity-floobity!

455
00:19:44,951 --> 00:19:46,517
            (grunts)

456
00:19:46,519 --> 00:19:47,652
             Mom?!

457
00:19:47,654 --> 00:19:48,619
             Steve!

458
00:19:48,621 --> 00:19:50,821
          Let's get out of here.

459
00:19:50,823 --> 00:19:52,490
   What about my sensor tag?

460
00:19:52,492 --> 00:19:53,991
      You'll never get me
      through those gates.

461
00:19:53,993 --> 00:19:55,693
             (snap)

462
00:19:55,695 --> 00:19:57,328
Whoa. How'd you do that?

463
00:19:57,330 --> 00:19:59,197
                This is me we're
                  talking about.

464
00:19:59,199 --> 00:20:02,633
 The woman who once crotchwalked
         an oven out of a Sears.

465
00:20:02,635 --> 00:20:04,635
Crotchwalked?

466
00:20:04,637 --> 00:20:06,037
Oh, dear.

467
00:20:09,141 --> 00:20:10,341
          Thanks for the access.

468
00:20:10,343 --> 00:20:12,577
            I'll be sure to give
             a favorable report.

469
00:20:12,579 --> 00:20:14,412
Thank you,
and may I just say,

470
00:20:14,414 --> 00:20:16,614
you look in no way
suspicious to me.

471
00:20:19,151 --> 00:20:20,751
             (pop)
    Aah!

472
00:20:20,753 --> 00:20:22,220
Just send me
back to work.

473
00:20:22,222 --> 00:20:23,688
I can't be
all up in that.

474
00:20:23,690 --> 00:20:25,489
          She's trying
   to liberate a shoplifter!

475
00:20:25,491 --> 00:20:27,024
          Seize them!

476
00:20:27,026 --> 00:20:28,926
    I'm really
    sorry, Mom.

477
00:20:28,928 --> 00:20:30,828
    I blew it
    for both of us.

478
00:20:30,830 --> 00:20:32,897
                 You didn't blow
              anything, sweetie.

479
00:20:32,899 --> 00:20:37,401
         I've still got one last
 shoplifting trick up my sleeve.

480
00:20:37,403 --> 00:20:40,404
          (explosion)

481
00:20:40,406 --> 00:20:41,939
       (machine gun fire)

482
00:20:41,941 --> 00:20:44,041
Not really
a shoplifting trick

483
00:20:44,043 --> 00:20:46,110
so much as one
of Dad's grenades, Mom.

484
00:20:46,112 --> 00:20:48,179
                  Hey, it worked
                      at Macy's!

485
00:20:48,181 --> 00:20:50,281
      (bullet ricocheting)

486
00:20:51,450 --> 00:20:53,517
      (crickets chirping)

487
00:20:56,421 --> 00:20:58,522
            Matilda!

488
00:21:17,075 --> 00:21:19,176
             Bitch.

489
00:21:26,918 --> 00:21:30,921
          Captioned by
   <font color="#00ffff">  Media Access Group at WGBH </font>
        <font color="#00ffff">access.wgbh.org</font>

490
00:21:30,923 --> 00:21:33,057
  Bye! Have a beautiful time.

